Package: phoenix-tools
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Phoenix OS Project <build@phoenix-os.io>
Depends: smartmontools, nvme-cli, lm-sensors, ufw, policykit-1
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: Phoenix OS System Tools and Helpers
 System-level helper scripts, polkit policies, and udev rules for Phoenix OS.
 Includes:
  - Disk operation safety rules (udev + udisks2 policy)
  - Polkit policies for privileged disk operations
  - Phoenix disk audit logging service
  - Shell utilities for repair workflows
  - System information gathering scripts
